OL,3,GNEWSAGold postbox to honor Manx athlete
OL,4,
OL,5,FA postbox has been painted gold in
OL,6,Fcelebration of a two-time gold-medalist
OL,7,Fathlete.
OL,9,FManx-born cyclist Matthew Bostock, from
OL,10,FMarown, was crowned world champion in
OL,11,Fthe 40km race at the 2026 Commonwealth
OL,12,FGames in August, andwon Men's scratch
OL,13,Frace at the UCI Track Cycling World
OL,14,FChampionships in China last month.
OL,16,FThe idea to honor the 29-year-old with
OL,17,Fa gold postbox was put to the Isle of
OL,18,FMan Post Office by Marown
OL,19,FCommissioners.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,447,445,260,140,0,100
